// `std::mt19937` generator—a high-quality pseudo-random number
// generator based on the Mersenne Twister algorithm.
//
// Next, we define `std::uniform_int_distribution<int>(1, 6)` to map
// the generator's output into the discrete interval [1, 6] with equal
// probability for each integer.
//
// Calling `dice_roll(generator)` yields one sample from that
// distribution—equivalent to observing the face value after a die
