// - Async scan: requires memory proportional to max_key * n_partitions * value_sz * n_tables
// - Sync scan: requires memory proportional to max_key * value_sz * n_tables
// Data size (DB content during test) approximates:
//   n_partitions * max_key * (12B + value_sz) * n_tables
//
// Key recommendations:
// - max_verify_ops_per_write >= keys_per_batch (to ensure verification coverage)
// - keys_per_batch <= active_width / 5 (to reduce random key generation overhead)
// - num_readers_per_partition <= max_verify_ops_per_write (for balanced load)

