//   - double follows IEEE 754 64-bit binary floating-point format
//   - tu_int represents a 128-bit unsigned integer type
//
// Bit layout for double:
// s eeeeeeee eeee mmmmmmmm mmmmmmmm mmmmmmmm mmmmmmmm | mmmmmmmm mmmmmmmm mmmmmmmm mmmmmmmm mmmmmmmm
